# Docker build context tune-down for the service Dockerfile.
#
# NOTE: `target/` is INTENTIONALLY NOT excluded - the Dockerfile does
# `COPY ${JAR_FILE:-target/*.jar}` against the pre-built jar and the
# GitHub Actions docker-build job drops the jar artifact into target/.
# Keep `src/` too: it keeps the image reproducibly buildable if a
# multi-stage Dockerfile is used later.

# --- VCS / IDE -------------------------------------------------------
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr

# --- Local / OS ------------------------------------------------------
*.log
logs/
*.tmp
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Reports / analysis (not needed in image) ------------------------
HELP.md
IMPLEMENTATION_REPORT.md
implementation.txt

# --- Docker ------------------------------------------------
.dockerignore
Dockerfile.*.tmp